      "notes": "Melatonin works in harmony with your natural sleep cycle to give you the tranquil rest you deserve, so you can awaken feeling refreshed. Inspired by the natural rhythm of life, Melatonin is a great choice for people experiencing occasional sleeplessness, those with jet lag, or those seeking to improve their quality of rest."
